{"id":"steam-711590","steam":711590,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"TFF: The Final Frontier","summary":"The Final Frontier is a game about star battles and meaning of freedom. It’s a fascinating journey through the endless, procedurally generated space in a universe where you struggle for freedom taking a role of the rebel leader.","about":"The Final Frontier is a game about star battles and the meaning of freedom. It’s a fascinating journey through the endless, procedurally generated space in a universe where you struggle for freedom taking the role of the rebel leader.\r\n\r\n\n\r\n• Fight with Imperial Forces - command your own fleet based on various spaceships choosing from 4 different races. \r\n• Prevent your resources from depleting or end up dying in cold space.\r\n• Protect your mothership with advanced tactic and fleet orders by taking advantage over your enemy in tactical encounters in a real-time battle system with active pause.\r\n• Reveal the story of a dystopian future, where the inability of choosing own life path leads to rebellion.\r\n\n\r\n\r\nThe legacy of each reel fleet might influences state of the whole galaxy, so every next run of the game will give you a chance to end your quest of really freeing up the people.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711590/portrait.png?t=1670532875","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711590/header.jpg?t=1670532875","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711590/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1670532875","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711590/header.jpg?t=1670532875","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711590/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1670532875","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711590/ss_83c128c0c363fd688c5c7a1f48fbb19734fd8f5e.600x338.j